    "result_text": "Build succeeds and all tests pass (`Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`).\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec asked for `contactPreference` = `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`, exposed on the owner returned by `GET /api/owners/{id}`.\n\nI made two changes, following the repo's existing derived-field pattern (like `membershipLevel`, `locality`):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property (enum `EMAIL`/`PHONE`) to the `Owner` schema, so the OpenAPI generator produces the field plus a `ContactPreferenceEnum` on `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `contactPreference` and a `contactPreference(Owner)` default method returning `EMAIL` when the email is non-blank, else `PHONE`.\n\nBoth acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) pass.",
